OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAny fog patches will be slow to
OL,6,Fclear on Monday morning, but bright or
OL,7,Fsunny spells gradually developing.
OL,8,FCoastal showers will slowly die out.
OL,9,FCool.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA dry evening with clear
OL,12,Fspells, allowing areas of fog or
OL,13,Ffreezing fog and frost to develop
OL,14,Fovernight. Isolated coastal showers.
OL,15,
OL,16,CTuesday:FAreas of fog will be slow to
OL,17,Fclear on Tuesday morning, but sunny
OL,18,Fspells slowly developing. Isolated
OL,19,Fcoastal showers continuing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
